=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Partial allow policy$
$
  ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Status               Active$
  [ ] Incoming policy      Allow$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
$
  SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] [::]:22              Allowed$
  [+] 0.0.0.0:22           Allowed$
$
  Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  No firewall rules configured$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set deny policy      Let SSH through, deny by default$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
   3) Trusted Interfaces   Add, remove, apply$
   4) Disable firewall     Stop ufw (not recommended)$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-4 or q]: 0$
$

